<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Kaleido Design Ablative Quantitative Results</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Kaleido Design Ablative Quantitative Results ‣ Scaling Sequence-to-Sequence GenerativeNeural Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> presents the full quantitative results supporting the ablation study in Fig. <a href="#S3.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ (ii) Unified Positional Encoding for Space and Time ‣ 3.2.1 Designing Kaledio’s Design Spaces ‣ 3.2 Kaleido Architecture Details and Training Strategies ‣ 3 Kaleido: Scaling Rectified Flow Transformers for Generative Rendering ‣ Scaling Sequence-to-Sequence GenerativeNeural Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, including all alternative design decisions we explored. To provide a comprehensive comparison, we report performance across three settings: one-to-five, five-to-one, and five-to-five reference-to-target views.</p>
</div>
