<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span><span id="A3.T6.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Zero-shot SSIM/LPIPS Performance with Generative Methods.</span> Kaleido achieves state-of-the-art performance across all object- and scene-level benchmarks, with SSIM and LPIPS metrics consistent with the superior PSNR performance reported in Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Compared to Generative NVS Methods ‣ 4.2 Results on Novel View Synthesis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Scaling Sequence-to-Sequence GenerativeNeural Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
